@startuml
title Home-screen schedules (own recording / linked-patient viewing)
actor User
participant "Android widget" as Widget
participant "Dart widget callback" as Callback
database "Encrypted dose store" as Store
participant "Existing dose sync worker" as Sync
participant "Completion API" as API
participant "Caregiver monitoring API" as Monitoring

User -> Callback: Set home schedule source (self / patients)
Callback -> Store: Persist shared source; invalidate incompatible actions
alt Linked patients (read-only)
Callback -> Monitoring: Fetch active linked-patient snapshots
Monitoring --> Callback: Links, aliases and today's dose statuses
Callback -> Store: Validate account, date and refresh revision\nCache separately from own dose outbox
Callback -> Widget: Read-only patient pages; no take/cancel tokens
User -> Widget: Patient arrows / slot arrows and dots
Widget -> Widget: Select patient and slot locally (no write)
User -> Widget: Open displayed patient's schedule
Widget -> Callback: Opaque patient key + navigation context
Callback -> Store: Resolve active-account current-day linked patient
Callback -> User: Existing read-only patient detail screen
else Own schedules

User -> Widget: Select previous/next arrow or page dot
Widget -> Widget: Change visible slot locally (no dose write)\nShow taken and remaining medicines
alt Incomplete slot
User -> Widget: Tap Taken (remaining medicines only)
else Completed slot
User -> Widget: Tap Undo dose (all medicines in displayed slot)
end
Widget -> Widget: Persist opaque action token
Widget -> Callback: Wake background execution
Callback -> Store: Validate active account, date and displayed slot token
group SQLite transaction
Store -> Store: Validate action kind, displayed medication IDs / prior state
Store -> Store: Consume token + enqueue stable operation ID\ncompleted=true for Taken, false for Undo dose
Store -> Store: Project pending records and select next incomplete slot\n(in configured time order; complete when none remain)
end
Store --> Callback: Local saved state
Callback -> Widget: All slot pages + next slot + pending sync + acknowledge token
alt Taken
Widget -> Widget: Advance the initiating widget to next incomplete slot
else Undo dose
Widget -> Widget: Keep cancelled slot selected; enable Taken again
end
Callback -> Sync: Schedule upload
loop Until acknowledged (ordered, same operation ID)
Sync -> Store: Claim next operation
Sync -> API: Existing completion-operations request
API --> Sync: Receipt + authoritative schedule
Sync -> Store: Atomically acknowledge and cache
end
Sync -> Widget: Server saved state
User -> Widget: Tap schedule summary
Widget -> Callback: Open own schedule in app (no write)
end
note over Widget,Store
Logout/account switch clears the previous account's display.
Without an account snapshot, show sign-in guidance and a Sign in action.
Hide dose progress and refresh; open authentication without a dose write.
Old-day, replayed and incompatible actions do not write.
No authentication tokens, credentials or account IDs in PendingIntent data.
end note
@enduml
